<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Zekaria chekhai, now arui khin dow 520-517 BC takra kowi chekhai. Risi Zekaria dow cham takhangra kowi uowi mih aia maru-uüa tut-e kowh Thurai lai tek mih risi chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow Zekaria mih khi mukmang raiat kat chekhai. Nami mukmang kowi aia khi-ah mih auan dow maiawng: Judauüa hai Israeluüa mih nar hownia nauang plan hanow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim nauang chang iawk kown, now Jerusalem marow kowi athaulangma nauowi büah iawk kown. Nami klen kowi ransu-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nachet pe tara hanow naripah kown mih paw Zekaria tekla khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Now pur prakowi khin krama kung kowi Isu krista nauang chowm mang kown mih paw Zekaria tekla khai. Zekaria tek mih: Mang nauang uowi lowk ia kown. Nami mang dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi chowm se Jerusalem kowi nauang kup kown, now nami mang dow chenchap maten vüi taking tasangra nauang thawp kown. Nami mang dow palusama kowi nauang chowm mang kown (Zekaria 9:9-10). Nami mang kowi dow “Mia prek” padow rük pe ming khai (Zekaria 3:8, 6:12).</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Maibu towng: Maibu towng pami dow maibu towkra chekhai. Tawkche Baibul kowi kowh uowi mih maibu towng dow iawng pami maibu towng nadowi. Nami dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih maibu towng chekhai. Nami maibu towng kowi dow maibu chowm rah uowi ranit klüng chekhai. Nami dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh towah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Saktuak nataplanla kownkow peah prengia mih 1:1-6</para>
  <para style="io1">Zekaria khi mukmang mih 1:7-6:8</para>
  <para style="io1">Josua kowi kruk pe mang lukruk mih 6:9-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Nakhang hawm kown mih lawnguan kowi Judauüa lünta mih 7:1-8:23</para>
  <para style="io1">Mesia nauang kown mih lawnguan kowi pur pra laiklow 9:1-11:17</para>
  <para style="io1">Mesia nauang plan uang iawk kown mih lawnguan kowi pur pra laiklow 12:1-14:21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang plan kown mih hawk klow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Persia pren kowi Darius chowm mang mih pre ning hown raiat la khe risi Zekaria tut-e CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang towm khai. Zekaria dow Berekia kowh chapa chekhai, Berekia dow Ido kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />Zekaria kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Enni pipu-uüa luk kowi lainowmma ang kunmarau khai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Naiawng rakowi en matia chenchapuüa kowi kowtek pe dit, ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk; ang prakowi pauang plan büa lah. Ang prakowi che enni uang plan now ang paw enni prakowi nauang plan dang kown. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Enni pipu-uüa iawng hang uowi büa diah. Enni pipu-uüa kowi lup ngak hown akiang ngak natowta kownkow alai kowh risiuüa hown ang kowphuang pe khowk chowdiah; tawkchedow chün büah dowi, ang laiklow mih sünta kown khowm nau büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Nami khin khe kowh enni pipu-uüa tawng kowi chow kawmat? Alai kowh risiuüa chowngchowng saksakma tawi uowila enni tak bow? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Tawkchedow alai kowh ang kowh lup chang miuüa, krawi tek ang laiklow miuüa hown ang pring hawiah khowk chowdiah. Naiawngün ang kowh laiklow hai ari arow enni pipu-uüa chün dowi rakowi ka ripra khai. Nami khin khe dow tarip büah hanow, ‘A-i kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hai a-i kowh akiang krang powm iawng nape a-i kown pahai lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tekta iawng a-i luk kowi aia chang khai nowm,’ pabüah khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukmang pakat: <optbreak /> Kawrnga hawmh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Darius chowm mang mih pre ning hown lailowk la (Hebraiuüa tek pe “Shebat” la mih) pirmi laitali ni khe Berekia chapa risi Zekaria tut-e CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih uang ting khai iawk. <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Risi Zekaria tek mih: Uar-e ang khi mukmang lowk. Mukmang kowi maru powm iawng kramamu lowk ia mih kawrnga aringma mih luk kowi chowm mih ang khi khai. Nami kawrnga dow lawngrawi kowi kowh naingsa singh krüa kowi iowng phülü khai. Aiamat kung kowi dow aboma mih, arikma mih hai akawma mih kawrnga ün uowi khai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Now ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu uowi lowk ia, nami kowi ang tek pe mih, “Aw chakramang, pai iawngün kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa mia chow?” pakhai. Now aia dow, “Ang tek en sow,” padow klang ang khai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Now aram nam iungma mih singh plum takra kowi kawrnga hown kowh iowng mih CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek ang mih, “Palusama kowi nakrawi mü kownkow pai iawngünuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG chinah mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Nami khin khe nami kramamu kowi akeng mih kawrnga kowi kowh kramamu-uüa uang tek pe mih, “Palusama kowi anging cham krawi len khowk, now palusama thaulangma uowi mih anging khi khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek mih, “Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, Jerusalem marow hai Juda pren kowi kowh akeng mih marow maten luk kowi ranitkawm ning khowk en kunmarau mih tawng khe tak chow amatni kowi en sanaah kown?” pakhai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Nami khin khe ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu kowi sakklamra hai lai iung ahuma CHAKRAMANG tek pe khai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Naiawng rakowi nami kramamu tek ang mih: Mami laiklow kowkrawi phuang diah, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jerusalem kowi kowh Zaiawn maru-uüa kowi lainowmma ang saksingah khai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Tawkchedow asowrma uowi mih akeng prenchakuüa luk kowi lainowmma ang kunmarau khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang maru-uüa kowi ang ripah ditchow mih khin khe amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi amaisang uang hing piakta khai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem marow luk kowi sanaah kownkow ang nauang plan iawk kown. Jerusalem marow kowi dow asar hai nathawpah iawk kown; nahanow nakowi dow ang matia kowh kim chimsaima mih nathawpah iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Mami paw kramamu pe tek ang khai: Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang takham khowk; ang kowh Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten kowi iungra nave iawk kown. Zaiawn marow kowi ang napeah sakklamra iawk kown; Jerusalem marow kowi ang nalang kloah iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukmang pre kat: <optbreak /> Nang tali klüng hai laksma tali ia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Nami kung kowi dow ang tang mü hanow ang khi nang tali klüng khai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19-21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19-21" />Now ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Pai iawngün auan tawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19-21">Now aia dow klang ang mih, “Pai iawngün dow nang chekhai. Pai iawngün nang dow akeng prenchakuüa kowh kür chekhai. Juda, Israel hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi kür hown cham uetah now akeng pren kowi cham pe uowiah nar mih dow pai iawngün nang chowbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19-21">Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG tüng ang <char style="w">laksma</char> tali ia khai. Now kramamu kowi ang plan lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow kowbüah uang chang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19-21">Now aia klang ang mih, “Kowbüah dow laksma chekhai. Kowbüah dow nang tali klüng mih kowi natüng pe kramra kownkow hai napiakta kownkow uang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:19-21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang sum kat: <optbreak /> Akhai müa leng dowkma mih maru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Nami kung kowi ang plan khi mukmang lowk iawk. Mukmang kowi akhai müa leng dowkma mih klanguüa ang khi lowk ia. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Now nami maru kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en cham kowi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Now aia klang ang mih, “Jerusalem marow mün khowt chow iuk mih natukla kownkow kowkhai kown ang tarü mih chaw,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Now ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu powt kown chowbowt khe aia hown nauang taklang kownkow akeng mih kramamu uang ting lowk ia. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Uang ta ting mih kramamu kowi ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu tek pe mih, “Kowiowmah now paimi akhai müa leng dowkma mih klanguüa kowi kowtek pe dit: Jerusalem marow kowi maru hai tawncher ahuma naprung kown chekhai. Tap lak kowi takowi büah dowi bowt tham. Naiawng rakowi tap uowi dowi mih marow kowi iawng nauowi büah bowt kown. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Chakramang tek marow tapat lut maih hown kowh tap iawng aiamat nauowi kown pe, now nami marow kowi kowh rowsira dow aiamat ngengche naown kown pe,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nar hownia nauang plan kownkow CHAKRAMANG hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Akeng pren kowi maru nar kowi nacham uowila kownkow ang cham uet enni khai nowm. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow sakkrowng büa diah! Tawngphak pra kowh pren hownia alenma uang powt büa diah. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Aw Zaiawn maru-uüa, Babulawn pren hownia uang powt büah bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG aia kowh kraingra natüngla kownkow uang rup enni dawngthawnguan mih prenchakuüa maten tut-e uang chin ang mih chekhai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Kak enni miuüa dow ang mik chah kowi kowh kak mih chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Naiawng rakowi ang matia ang nasenah kown. Now amatni matia kowh naruüa dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan narupta pe lai kown,” pakhai. Naiawng uang phaw mih khin khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG enni tut-e uang chin ang mih pami enni natuk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Zaiawn chama, ang uang tarü khowk. Enni tut-e ang natawi uowi kown. Naiawng rakowi piaw hai awmrawm meng tek büa diah. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Nami khin khe dow prenchak ahuma ang hown nauang tabawng hanow ang maru nauang chowng kown. Enni pungmadawng kowi ang natawi uowi kown,” pakhai. Naiawng uang phawh mih khin khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG enni tut-e uang chin ang mih chekhai pami enni natuk kown. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Pren chimsaima mih kowi Judauüa uowi rah dow CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kloah mih naown kown. Jerusalem dow aia lang sakrauah nowm nowm mih marow naown iawk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang kowi kowh aia kim chimsaima mih hownia uang tarü khowk. Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi kowh maru maten mih aia pur kowi rarimma uowi büa diah.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang Tali kat: <optbreak /> Uamow lang kri mih kowi chimsaiah mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Now ang plan khi mukmang lowk iawk. Nami mukmang kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu ria kowi uamow lang kri mih Josua iowng mih ang khi khai. Now Josua kowi napeah aprek kownkow hawmlawm prakowi <char style="w">Setan</char> paw tawi iowng khai. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu Setan kowi tek pe mih, “Setan, CHAKRAMANG pacham nang en lah! Jerusalem kowi kowh sakrau mih CHAKRAMANG pacham nang en lah. Maih hownia kowh khowngta mih sawp dung iawng dow mami maru kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih lowmow,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Nami khin khe Josua dow asürlawima mih tawnguat khupma hown nami kramamu pur kowi tawi iowng khai. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Now aia ria kowi kowh iowng mih kramamu-uüa kowi nami kramamu tek pe mih, “Josua kowh tawnguat asürlawima mih klüpta pe diah,” pape khai. Now klüpta pe kung kowi nami kramamu tek pe Josua mih, “Josua, en kowh angak ang henta en khowk; kawmat dow uamow tawnguat klangiungma mih ang nakhup en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Now Josua kowi nasui pe napawng kaw sar kownkow ang tawi tek pe khai. Naiawng rakowi kramamu-uüa mih Josua kowi sui pe napawng kaw sar hanow khup pe tawnguat sar khai. Nakhowk khe paw CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih amatni re-e tawi iowng reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pur pra kowh lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe Josua mih, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek en mih maiawng, ‘En che ang tiama kowi mang hai ang laiklow chün hanow ang kowh kim chimsaima mih hai viadawng kowi kowh lowra luk kowi namingkhet kown mih alow ang nape en kown. Now kawmat kowh ang ria kowi iowng mih kramamu-uüa iawng dow en paw ang pur kowi natawi ka iowng kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />CHAKRAMANG kutplan tek iawk mih, ‘Aw uamow lang kri mih Josua, sünta diah. En pur kowi kowh chowm mih akeng mih uamowuüa paw pacham sünta lah. Pur prakowi ang nauang pawla ang nar kown. Aia kowi dow Mia Prek padow narükah kown, now enni uamowuüa dow nami Mia Prek nauangla kown mih ni vüi amatra chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Josua, en pur kowi ranit dam mih huaklu ang towta lowk. Nami huaklu kowi ang narui pe laiklow lowk kown. Now mami pren maru-uüa kowh angak maten pani sang ang nahenta pe kown. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />Nami ni khe dow thaulangma enni nauowi bowt kown; enni bowkbowk chowlowkkow grep mung krüa hai uidut singh tut kowi taiua chowm kownkow auiuauüa kowi enni nahaw kown. Ang, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang tanga kat: <optbreak /> Kuh maibu towng hai kanrawn pre singh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Nami kung kowi ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu uang plan hanow müi mih kowi kowh krüngah iawng uang lowk ang khai. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Now kramamu lünta ang mih, “Tawng chow en khi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Now ang tek pe mih, “Kuh hown kowh maibu towng ang khi lowk. Nami maibu towng luk kowi maibu towk müa sau puh uowi lowk. Nami maibu towng kowi dow maibu uowi ranit klüng, now nami maibu maten kowi maibulia uowi ranit klüng chi chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Nami maibu towng ria kowi dow kanrawn uowi pre singh: hawmlawm pra uowi asingh, lakuai pra uowi asingh,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Now nami kramamu kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Aw chakramang, pai iawngün auan tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Now aia klang ang mih, “Pai iawngün auan tawng chow, en tuk dowi ü?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Now ang tek pe mih, “Ang tuk dowi le chakramang,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4: </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">10b </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Maiawng 5 uan chur kowi 10b uang uowi mih dow auan uang towkala kownkow uang kenah mih chekhai.</char>
    </note> Khowt now kramamu tek ang mih, “Paimi maibu ranit klüng mih dow palusama kowi khila mih CHAKRAMANG kowh mik chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Now nami kramamu kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Paimi maibu towng ria re-e kowh hawmlawm pra lowk, lakuai pra lowk kanrawn singh uowi mih auan tawng chow?” pakhai. <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Nami klen kowi ang plan lüntaah mih, “Paimi kanrawn singh mia pre buk mih atowr kowi kowh kuh rowng hownia kuh iawng asüachow mih sau uang lawt khai. Now nami sau dow kuh maibu towng luk kowi kowh uowi mih puh kowi uang hawr khai. Pai iawngün singh mia auan dow tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Nakhowk khe aia klang ang mih, “Paimi singh mia pre buk mih auan tawng chow, en tuk dowi ü?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Now ang tek pe mih, “Aw chakramang, ang tuk dowi le,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Nakhowk khe aia tek ang mih, “Paimi singh mia pre buk mih auan dow palusama kowh CHAKRAMANG lup nachang kownkow nami sau phawk pe now nümah napah mih maru pre ia chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zerubabel nachang CHAKRAMANG chup kim iawk kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Now ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu tek ang mih, “Mami dow Zerubabel tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai. Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih: En matia kür hai en matia nowng changra hown nadowi. Tawkche ang lümla kür hown en nanowng chang kown, ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />Aw Zerubabel, akrat pusara mih lang kro mih hungh iawng uang uowi chepaw en tut-e dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai; en pur kowi dow dowm anaima mih iawng nauang own kown. Ang kowh kim chimsaima mih en nachang iawk kown. Ang kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi kowh lang pankri mih hua dup mih khin khe dow maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Klangiung khai, lainowmma klangiung khai,’ padow nahow sawmlawm kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Nami kung kowi paw CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih ang Zekaria tut-e uang towm khai iawk. <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />Nami laiklow dow maiawng, “Zerubabel mih ang kowh kimchüng phük mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kim chang chur kown mih paw aiamat rut hown naown kown. Nami khin khe dow ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG amatni tut-e ang uang chin en mih chekhai pami maru-uüa natuk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10a" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10a" />“Ditchow hown kowh awr uown changah mih lup kowi maru nüah klowkah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Zerubabel rut kowi kowh kim chang müa uanh khi hanow maru mih lainowmma naawmrawm bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 4:10a" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang taruk kat: <optbreak /> Charam tua iow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Nami kung kowi ang plan tang mü hanow charam tua aphatma kuang dawng kowi iow mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Nahanow ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu lünta ang mih, “Tawng chow en khi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Now ang klangah mih, “Charam iow mih ang khi lowk. Nami charam aklang dow pirmi muk, aphia dow hamüt muk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Now aia tek ang mih, “Nami charam kowi arui uowi mih dow mami pren paprenma kowi nauang kla kown mih piati laiklow chekhai. Nami charam padam prakowi arui uowi mih dow pren kowi kowh kuk miuüa piakra laiklow chekhai. Now akeng dam prakowi kowh arui uowi mih dow pren kowi kowh dai lai tek miuüa piakra laiklow chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Kuk miuüa kim kowi hai ang ming hown kowh tek dai lai miuüa kim kowi nami piati dow ang nauang chin pe kown. Nami piati dow amatni kim kowi nahing uowi hüah kown; now amatni changla kim mih singh hown hua hailawm asaima napiakta pe kown,’” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukmang ranit kat: <optbreak /> Puh lak kowi kowh masiuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Nami kung kowi ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu uangah hanow tek ang mih, “Kuang prakowi sam mü madiah, tawng chabak uang mih,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Nakhowk khe ang lüntaah mih, “Awr mih tawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Now aia klang ang mih, “Awr mih dow puh chekhai,” pakhai. Nami klen kowi aia plan tek ang iawk mih, “Awr mih puh kowi uowi mih dow Juda pren paprenma maru kowh angak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Now nami puh küm mih hoah hanow nakowi dow masiuüa uowi lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Now kramamu tek ang mih, “Mami masiuüa ming dow angak chekhai,” pakhai. Now nami masiuüa kowi dow puh kowi iu napah hanow adikma mih aküm müa hown asima kümah khai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Nami kung kowi ang tang mü hanow masiuüa pre ia uang iow mih ang khi khai. Amatchi kowh lap dow iammow uakaw lap iawng chekhai. Amatchi dow nami puh kowi krowngla hanow kuang prakowi iowla iüah khai. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Nami khin khe ang hown kowh taklang mih kramamu kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Tawng prakowi chow nami puh kowiüah cham pawla?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Now Kramamu tek ang mih, “Paimi puh dow Babulawn pren prakowi cham pawla mih chekhai. Paimi puh lak kowi kowh masiuüa vüi nakowi nathawp pe chup kim lowk kown. Now nami kim ki thawp kung kowi dow nami masiuüa kowi maru nachupah kownkow nami kim kowi natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang raiat kat: <optbreak /> Kawrnga kari tali klüng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Nami kung kowi ang plan tang mü hanow ang khi kawrnga kari tali klüng. Naiawngün kawrnga kari dow hungh pre buk mih takra hownia kowh uang lawt mih chekhai. Nami hungh pre buk mih dow kri hungh chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Naiawngün kawrnga kari tali klüng mih dow aringma mih kawrnga kangowh küngah mih lowk, anumma mih kawrnga kangowh küngah mih lowk, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />akawma mih kawrnga kangowh küngah mih lowk, now asauthuama mih kawrnga kangowh küngah mih lowk chekhai; kawrnga maten dow akürma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Nahanow auown hownia kowh ang hown taklang mih kramamu kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Aw chakramang, naiawngün auan tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Now aia klang ang mih, “Naiawngün dow pren tali tingnui pra kowh cham kowi mih li chowbowt; amatni dow palusama kowh CHAKRAMANG pur hownia uang lawt mih chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Anumma mih kawrnga kari dow tawngphak pra kowh cham kowi mih, akawma mih kawrnga kari dow satkup pra kowh cham kowi mih, now asauthuama mih kawrnga kari dow mrawkphak pra kowh cham kowi mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Akürma mih kawrnga hawmh dow uang lawt hanow palusama kowi nacham krawi mü kownkow lainowmma sakkrowng khai. Naiawng rakowi kramamu tek pe mih, “Tarü büah bowt, palusama kowi tawng ngai chow own mih cham krawi mü büah bowt,” pakhai. Now amatni dow palusama kowi cham krawi mü kownkow tarü khai. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Nahanow kramamu haw ang now tek ang mih, “Sünta, tawngphak pra kowh cham kowi miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura prowngta pe khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow lang kri mih Josua vüi mang lukruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10-11" />“Babulawn pren kowi kowh cham takhang mih Helem, Tobija hai Jedaia büah uang plan khowk. Kowbüah tut-e kowkowi hanow kuh hown tai mih kowpaw diah. Now nami ni kowi Zefania chapa Josia kim kowi kowkowi diah. Now nami kuh hown tai mih thawpla mang lukruk diah, now nami mang lukruk mih Jehozadak chapa Josua lu kowi kruk pe diah. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Now Josua kowi tek pe dit, ‘Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih: Mami dow Mia Prek pape mih maru chekhai; nami Mia Prek dow aiamat uowi rah hownia naawr iuksown hanow nathawp CHAKRAMANG chup kim kown. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />CHAKRAMANG chup kim dow aia mih nachang ngengche kown. Aia kowi dow mang kiowrira napeah kown; aia dow mang chowm rah kowi nachowm hanow nakruitown pren kown. Aia dow uamow iawng aia mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kown; naiawng rakowi mang rah hai uamow rah, arah pre buk mih dow thaulangma hown aia nachün kown,’ pape diah. <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Now Helem, Tobija, Jedaia hai Zefania chapa Josia büah kowi tukla reng kownkow rutmit iawng mang lukruk dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Zekaria kutplan tek mih, “Alakma kowi kowh uowi miuüa nauangah hanow nauang khowng CHAKRAMANG kim chang kown. Nami khin khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG enni tut-e uang chin ang mih pami enni natuk kown. Tawkchedow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai lai süngürma hown enni chün khü chiang naiawngün maten nauang phawh bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG naukhi dowi mih hawm khang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Mang Darius chowm mang mih tali ning nga taku la (Hebraiuüa tek pe Chislev la mih) tali ni khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow Zekaria tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2-3" />Nami khin khe lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh uowi mih uamowuüa hai risiuüa tut-e nakowlü prasira kownkow Bethel kowi kowh maru-uüa mih kowchin maru khai. Amatni kowchinah mih maru-uüa dow Sharezer hown Regem-Melek hown amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi chekhai. Now nami maru-uüa dow uamowuüa hai risiuüa kowi kowlüntaah mih, “Ning kawmma anging awr sunla reng khowk iawng dow tanga la mih kowi hawm khang hown kar hown nguk hown anging nasun iawk kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 7:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Nami khin khe lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang towm khai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Juda pren kowi kowh maru maten hown uamowuüa kowi kowtek pe dit: Ranitkawm ning mowr tanga la hai ranit la kowi kowh hawm khang hown kar hown nguk hown enni sun mih dow ang vüi kowi kowh enni sun mih nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Now enni cha enni kham khe paw enni matia mu duh müa enni cha enni kham mih chowtaih. <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Jerusalem hown ariaret kowi kowh marow kowi maru akawmma uowi khai. Naiawngün marow mih lainowmma awr iuksown khai. Nami klen kowi Negeb hown satkup prakowi kowh awkaw kowi paw maru atekma uowi khai. Nami khin khe paw maiawngün ang kowh laiklow alai kowh risiuüa tek khowk nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chün lai dowi rakowi nar kowi cham uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Now CHAKRAMANG kutplan tek ang iawk mih, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9-10" />“Alai khe paw ang maru-uüa kowi maiawng ang tek pe khowk, ang tek pe mih, ‘Tara anowmma chetah büah; lowkkowlowk kaah sakowm iawng uowiah büah, tasaksing sanara atekma hown uowiah büah. Mamaimow, saratchow, prenlang maru hown ngarai miuüa kowi hang chang nowng büah; lowkkowlowk hang talima kuaichai büah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Nachenganchepaw ang maru-uüa mih naiawngün lai nau sünta ang büah dowi; amatni dow laimiama chekhai. Amatni dow dangta ang kung hanow hang pacham ta lah pakowh param paw pitta büah khai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Ari-arow paw chün büah kown nau dowi kowh amatni kowh sak mih huaklu iawng akhawtma changah büah khai. Ang, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, ang lümla hown kowh alai kowh risiuüa kowi ang pe tekah mih laiklow paw sünta büah dowi. Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi lainowmma ang kunmarauah khai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />Amatni kowi ang hawah khe paw sünta ang büah dowi. Naiawng kowh amatni haw ang khe paw ang sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Amatni kowi mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang cham pe tasetah khai. Nami kung kowi amatni kowh pren dow akhaw aklaima chekhai. Nakowi dow amiapaw iu mang awr mang mih khowm hing uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni kowh pren klangiungma mih dow akhaw aklaima changah büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi napeah prasi kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Now lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow Zekaria tut-e uang plan ting khai iawk. <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:2">“Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih kowi lainowmma ang sakrauah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:2">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi nowm nowm ang kunmarau khai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Zaiawn marow kowi ang uang plan khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:3">nakowi kowh hungh kowi ang nauowi reng bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:3">Jerusalem marow kowi dow ‘anowmma mih marow’ napape bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:3">lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG hungh kowi dow ‘hungh chimsai’ napape bowt kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Jerusalem marow kowi lawngtang matanguüa nauowi iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:4">Amatni dow raitua dowkma kangowh marow lak kowi thaulangma nalen büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:4">now akuangma mih arah kowi nachowm büah iawk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Marow kowi kowh viadawng kowi ngeuüa hawmh nauowi iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:5">nakowi dow ngeuuüa hawmh akawmma chi nangawk iawk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Tawkche sing uowi reng tak miuüa tuak kowi dow naiawngün nauang phaw kown mih lainowmma krat chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:6">ang tut-e dow nami tawngpaw krat dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:6">Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Satlawt pra kowh pren hownia ang maru-uüa kowi ang nauang lawngla kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:7">Satkup pra kowh pren kowi cham takhang mih ang maru-uüa kowi paw ang nauang plan pawla kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Amatni kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:8">Amatni mih ang maru nachowng büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:8">nahanow ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:8">amatni tut-e kaah sakowmma hai anowmma ang nauowi pe kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />“Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:9">ang kowh kim nathawp kownkow uown phük kimchüng hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:9">mami laiklow maten risiuüa tekla khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:9">Kawmat paw nami laiklow iawng enni ta khai iawk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:9">Naiawng rakowi sakkhawtma uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:9">ang kowh kim chimsaima mih enni nowng chang kown taih.<verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Nami lup uown dowi rawn khe dow sukkri kha pek müa khowm ka büah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:10">lup chang müa tawncher nga kha pek müa paw ka büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:10">Nami klen kowi amatni lala kowi ang towkah ran khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:10">Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa kowi kram hai thaulangma ia uowi büah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:10">Amiapaw asowrma cham ia mang cham ia kat büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Tawkche kawmat dow alai khe kowh iawng nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:11">kawmat kowh sing uowi reng tak miuüa kowi dow alai khe kowh iawng ang nachangah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />Nami maru-uüa dow thaulangma nasawt liu bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:12">grep ruih kowi dow uih achakma nauowi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:12">Mukuang hownia uang nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:12">now krawng kowi mih luprak ahuma nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:12">Naiawngün prasira maten dow kawmat kowh ta sing uowi miuüa atungma naka bowt kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Aw Juda hai Israel maru-uüa, maru cham pe piati towng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:13">‘Juda hai Israeluüa iawng pacham ownah’ padow maru rükla enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:13">Nachenganchepaw kawmat hownia ang nalawng enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:13">now maru cham tape prasi towng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:13">‘Juda hai Israeluüa iawng pacham ownah,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:13">padow maru narükla enni bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:13">Naiawng rakowi hangkow kram büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:13">sakkhawtma uowi büah rowt diah.<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14-15" />“Enni pipu-uüa dow towk ang kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">Nami khin khe naripah kownkow ang kamrüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">now ang kamrütta mih iawng ang ripah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow hangkow kram büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">ang, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">Jerusalem hai Juda maru-uüa kowi ang napeah iungra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:14-15">amatni kowi ang napeah iungra kownkow ang kamrütta khowk.<verse eid="ZEC 8:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Tawkchedow maiawngün ang alow pek enni chün kown takla:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:16">Lowkkowlowk tatek lainowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:16">tara chetra kowi tara nowm chetah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:16">Nahanow enni tut-e taking tasangra nauowi kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Lowkkowlowk hang talima kuaichai büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:17">now hang thuak dai lai saksi büah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:17">Ang CHAKRAMANG, naiawngün maten ang sui,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek ang iawk mih,<verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />“Tali la, tanga la, ranit la hown hamüt la kowi khang hawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:19">naiawngün hawm khang dow Juda maru-uüa vüi piawra naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:19">Amatni dow awmrawmma hown iungra pawi nasun büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:19">Tawkchedow anowm hai taking tasangra kowi nauah büa diah.<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />“Marow ahuma hownia Jerusalem kowi maru akawmma nauang kown mih khin nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:20">Nami khin khe dow chen towng chap towng maru akawmma Jerusalem kowi nauang kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Alowk mih marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru dow alowk mih marow kowi kowkowiah hanow kowtek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:21">‘Chu, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG prasira i kowlü lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:21">Aia kowi nakowchup kownkow i kowkowi lah,’ napa büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:21">Nami khin khe tawngbak mih dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:21">‘Ang paw tawi kown,’ napa büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Nauang chupiia ang kownkow akürma mih chenchapuüa nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:22">Ang prasira nauang lü kownkow maru akawmma nauang kown.<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Nami khin khe dow maiawng nauang own kown:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:23">Akeng chenchap hamüt ia chi Juda maru lowk ia tut-e nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:23">now Juda maru uanmawm kowi krawi tadowk se nakrawi tek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:23">‘Enni tut-e Thurai uowi pami anging ta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:23">Naiawng rakowi enni tut pawla anging dit,’ napa büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:23">Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:23">mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa riaret kowi kowh uowi miuüa vüi tara chetra hai lawngra</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Mami dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">CHAKRAMANG mik dow bowkbowk prakowi tang mü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">amülüngma hown Israel chenchap prakowi tang mü reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">Naiawng rakowi Hadrak hai Damaska marow kowi kingküaah kown CHAKRAMANG tekta mih laiklow dow nauang tachi kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Hadrak rihi kowi kowh Hamat marow kowi kingküa kown CHAKRAMANG tekta mih paw nauang tachi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">Sur hown Sidawn marow kowi kowh maru-uüa dow nowm nowm chanlai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:2">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi kingküaah kown mih laiklow dow nauang tachi kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Sur maru-uüa dow tap akroma mih thawpah lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">Nami dow amatni tahen müa thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">Amatni kowh tai tangka dow dinchow iawng ahuma uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">amatni kowh kuh paw tiama kowi kowh mawngchawng khowt hu khai.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow CHAKRAMANG narupta pe bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">amatni kowh tasen müa chawnlawng dow sata kowi aia nakuakta pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">now amatni kowh marow dow maih hown aia natowkta pe kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Naiawngün khi hanow Askelawn maru-uüa dow nakram kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza maru-uüa dow arau hown nachür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Naiawng phaw mih khi hanow Ekrawn maru-uüa kowh dow sakowmra nachur kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Naiawng rakowi amatni paw Gaza maru-uüa hown arau hown nachür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza kowi kowh mang kowi dow nasatta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">now Askelawn marow kowi dow amiapaw uowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Asdawd marow kowi dow prenlang maru chuprek chaprekuüa nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 9:6" />
  <para style="m" vid="ZEC 9:6">CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:6">“Filistinuüa kowh bawrira dow ang napiakta pe kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Vi hailawm chaknga ang pe chaah kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">nat ngar hai iung chaah dowi mih chakkham paw cha büah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Amatni pungmadawng kowi ta sing uowi ne kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">nami maru-uüa kowi dow ang maru ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Amatni dow Juda chenchap iawng natawi own büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ekrawn maru-uüa paw Jebusuüa iawng ang maru nauang chowng kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Krawi sen mih prenlang siphaiuüa rut hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">ang kim dow ang nahenah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Kawmat hownia ang maru-uüa ria kowi ang natawi uowila reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">Chang nowng mih maru-uüa dow ang maru-uüa tut-e nauang ia ting kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi mang uang tarü mih</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">“Aw Jerusalem marow, atünma how diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Aw ang kowh chama Zaiawn marow, ahuma awmrawm diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Mü diah, en kowh mang dow en tut-e uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Aia dow achinawmma mih mang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">aia dow lawng miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Aia dow khamsum khamdawma mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Aia dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi chowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">kawrngaramchük chah luk kowi chowm se uang tarü khowk.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Israel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Israel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami Hebrai Baibul kowi arui uowi mih dow Efraim chekhai, nami dow Israel pren tawngphak prakowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. 9:13 kowi paw arui uowi.</char></note> kowh tasen müa kawrnga kari ang napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Jerusalem kowh tasen müa kawrnga ang nahenta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">tasen müa leba maten ang napiakta pe bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Uang tarü khowk mih mang dow chenchapuüa tut-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">taking tasangra lai naphuang bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Aia naming nakhetah kown mih pren dow mami sata hownia akeng mih sata mowr chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Iufratis aw hownia prenchur nammowt mowr naown kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />“Aw Jerusalem, vi hown achi tatow sangbowk laitawm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">Naiawng rakowi akang khawngma mih kuam kowi takhang mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">akeng pren kowi cham takhang mih en maru-uüa kowi ang nakrawi lawngah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Ang khowngra ka kown sakowmma hown uowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">akeng pren kowi kowh cham takhang miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">enni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi plan büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">Ang takham khowk, maru pawta enni mih maten ang naplan pe enni iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">auown khe kowh lak-e pre phow chi ang nape enni kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Juda maru-uüa kowi dow ang kowh leba iawng ang natawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">Israel kowi dow ang kowh leba sek iawng ang natawngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Aw Zaiawn, en maru-uüa kowi ang natawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">Gris maru-uüa kowi nasenla kownkow en maru-uüa kowi ang natawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">amatni kowi dow saidawng iawng ang natawngah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nalawngah kown</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Nami kung kowi dow aia maru-uüa tut-e CHAKRAMANG nauang tatüng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">aia kowh leba sek dow pla nowi iawng nakhi-ah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">CHAKRAMANG dow natum baw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">aia dow liku iawng mrawkphak prakowi namang kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">aia kowh siphaiuüa dow huaklu hown ransu-uüa kowi nasenah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">aia kowh maru-uüa dow ransu-uüa kowi nanowngta kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">Amatni dow awng pawi kowi nakham grep tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">pua miuüa iawng dow nahow sawmlawm büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">Phuchuara ria kowi puh hown kowh khükta mih vi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">amatni ransu-uüa kowh vi dow ahuma nalawt kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Nami ni khe dow ruapur hawmh kowi ruapur thing mih lawngah iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih aia maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Amatni dow amatni pren kowi kuh iawng natawk büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">mang kowh kuh lukruk iawng dow natawk büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Amatni dow lainowmma naiung bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">apowm paw lainowmma naklangiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">Pren kowi mih uih-ien pantawn lainowmma naiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Naiawng rakowi malauüa klanguüa hawmh paw lainowmma kow iung hown nakür kown.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">Juda hai Israeluüa naiungla kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow uang pek miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">Aia dow nathawp enni uangnim hanow nape enni uang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">aia dow uih-ien pantawn naiungla kownkow pe uang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Naiawng rakowi satma khin khe uang nauangla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">CHAKRAMANG tut-e lü büa diah.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Arup arenuüa hownia dow asung uowi dowi mih prengia enni ka reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">hawra sarauüa dow pur prakowi kowh lawnguan kowi küa dai reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Phuang mang miuüa dow dai lai hown pe sakowmra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">Tawkche nami sakowmra dow katpaw uang tachi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Naiawng rakowi enni dow tama mih ruapur iawng cham mangla pang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">enni kowh athing mih uowi dowi rakowi maru chang enni anowng apowng mih chekhai.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">“Ruapur thing miuüa luk kowi ang kunmarau lün pluplup khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Ang, lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, ang maru Judauüa kowi ang namingkhetah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">now tasen müa kawrnga iawng akürma ang nathawpah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Kimchüng maten kowi kowh lang pankri mih dow klawngdawng chüng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">tangbung kowi kowh lang pankri mih dow atük müa chüng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">tasen müa kowi kowh lang pankri mih dow leba chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">Nami powm iawng apankrima mih aluchowuüa maten dow Judauüa pungmadawng hownia nauang lawt kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Nami khin khe dow Juda maru-uüa akürma naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">amatni dow ransu-uüa kowi suplawk dawng kowi nathuaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Tasen mih khin khe paw amatni kowi ang natawi uowila kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">Naiawng rakowi kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi nanowngta büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />“Juda maru-uüa kowi akürma ang nathawpah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Israeluüa kowi ang nalawngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Amatni luk kowi ang kowh sanara uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Naiawng rakowi amatni pren kowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nami khin khe dow katpaw ang nuaah dowi tak mih iawng naown büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ang CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Naiawng rakowi amatni haw ang mih khin khe ang naklangah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Israeluüa dow siphai akürma miuüa iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">kham grep tui khe kowh iawng naawmrawm büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Nami khi hanow amatni kowh chauüa paw napiaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">amatni kowh sak dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi apiawma nauowi kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />“Amatni bowkbowk kowi hiu hown ang nahawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">amatni kowi arasang ang nakuaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Amatni kowi ang nalawngah kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">Naiawng rakowi alai kowh iawng maru iun akawmma naown büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Akeng chenchapuüa tut-e ang cham pe tasetah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">Nachenganchepaw pren lakma hownia natuk ang büah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Amatni hown amatni chauüa nasing reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">now amatni dow amatni pren kowi nauang plan büah bowk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowi ang nauang plan pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">Asuria pren hownia ang nauang pawla hanow arasang ang nakuaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Gilead hown Lebanawn pren kowi amatni kowi ang nauang towah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">nakowi dow amatni uowi rah takowi dowi mowr maru iun nahu büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Sata kowi kowh cham mang mih iawng akrat pusara nakrum büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Nachenganchepaw sata tuilowng dow ang narimta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Nail awma tui abüpma mih ün dow nakang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asuria pren kowi kowh maru-uüa bawrira dow ang nachurta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Aigupta pren kowi dow mang uowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Ang matia kür hown Israeluüa kowi akürma ang nathawpah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">now ang naukrang iawng amatni dow namang büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:12">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="s">Israel ransu-uüa kowh iungra nachur kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Aw Lebanawn, en kowh kimplawt dow uowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">en kowh aiuk akroma mih sidar singh maten kowi maih pauang kamah lah.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Aw karpowng singh, kar hai nguk hown uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow sidar singh dow tim khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Aw Basan pren kowi kowh sasua singh, kar hai nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow singh rüm krawngta kowi kowh singh maten dow kripta bowk khowk.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Ruapur thing miuüa kowh kar klow dow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">amatni kowh ruapur thing rah süng aiungma mih ün dow tapiak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Jawrdan aw ria kowi kowh kaurawng dow tapiak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">Naiawng rakowi krangsi hawmh kowh hek klow dow sünta büa diah.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa dow angakma mih ruapur thing miuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Ang kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek ang mih, “Zekaria, nalüa ngenah kown mih ruapur hawmh kowi mingkhet dit. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Naiawngün ruapur hawmh kowi ran miuüa hai angen miuüa dow ka ripra dowi chekhai. Naiawngün ruapur sum miuüa dow, ‘Ang kureng khowk, CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pauowi lah,’ padow chang bawri büah khai. Athing miuüa khowm padow amatni kowh ruapur hawmh kowi sanaah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Nami powm iawng dow mami pren kowi kowh maru maten kowi ang nasanaah kown nadowi bowt. Maru maten kowi amatni tasin taken miuüa hai mang tut-e ang naap-ah kown. Amatni tasin taken miuüa hai mang dow pren mih napiakta nak kown. Nachenganchepaw amatni rut hownia mia kowi paw ang nalawngah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Naiawng rakowi kun chang miuüa nalüa ngenah kown mih ruapur hawmh kowi dow ang mingkhet khai. Now ang paw raitua pre buk hanow ang chap pe ming khai: Lowk dow, “Sanara,” alowk mih dow, “Takrüpra,” padow ang chap pe khai. Now nami ruapur hawmh kowi dow ang mingkhet khai. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Now rik uowi mih ruapur thing mih sum ia kowi dow ala khowm chi dowi rawn ang prütta khai. Tawkchedow nami ruapur hawmh kowi ang taia khet dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ruapur hawmh dow sak-hiah ang khai. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Naiawng kowh ruapur hawmh kowi ang tek pe mih, “Ang thing enni dowi bowt. Kowng kown laiklow uowi mih dow kowng büah towbowt, now piak kown laiklow uowi mih dow pacham piakla towbowt. Ta lat miuüa dow lowkkowlowk tacha nga büah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Nami kung kowi “Sanara” pami raitua dow ang pawah hanow ang klowkta khai; naiawng hai chenchap maten hown ang kowh laikham uowi mih dow ang piakta khai bowt. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Now nami ni kowi nami laikham dow chur khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ruapur kun chang miuüa mih naiawngün khi hanow nami dow Thurai hownia kowh uang ting mih laiklow chekhai pami tuk büah khai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Now ruapur kun chang miuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, “Enni che pe ang ruapur thing kha kown nau khai hanow pe ang büah. Enni che pe ang kown nau dowi now hauang pe ang büah,” ang pape khai. Now amatni dow tai tangka süngkawmchow pe ang büah khai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Matawng iawng chowbowt chow naiawng khowtchow pache tuk pe en khai. Nami tai tangka Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tangka towk rah kowi kowkuakta khai,” pakhai. Now nami tai tangka süngkawmchow mih dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tangka towk rah kowi ang kowkuakta khai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Nami kung kowi alowk mih “Takrüpra” pami raitua paw ang klowkta khai; naiawng hai Judauüa hown Israeluüa kowh taichow nauchowra dow ang churta pe khai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Khaleng dow bualama mih ruapur thing mih kowh uan kutplan paw iawk diah. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami pren kowi e ang nauang pawla ruapur thing mih lowk ia kown; nami dow lainowmma nanga kown. Nami ruapur thing mih dow kla phih mih ruapur hawmh kowi namingkhet kown nadowi, cham taset miuüa kowi paw nakrawi cham kown nadowi, ka arau miuüa kowi paw narawah kown nadowi. Kow iungma miuüa kowi paw napeah chakkham lak dow nachaah kown. Now akeh kowi kowh anga pat naklawngah hanow nachata kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />Nami bualama mih ruapur thing mih kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Aia dow aia kowh ruapur hawmh kowi towla hüah hanow powtta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Naiawng rakowi aia kowh rut dow akeureuchow pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">aia kowh hawmlawm mik dow pacham hing du ngowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Saidawng dow aia kowh rut kowi pacham sawtah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">aia kowh hawmlawm mik kowi paw pacham sawtah lah.<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Ransu-uüa rut hownia Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh lawngra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang aphiama thawpah khai. Aia dow lusa pren chüng thawp miia chekhai, aia dow maru maten kowi kowh asak pek miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">Mami dow Israeluüa lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi dow arak bia iawng ang nachangah kown; nami kham hanow ariaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa dow arak pua mih iawng naown büah kown. Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi ransu-uüa uang senah mih khin khe akeng marow kowi kowh Judauüa kowi paw nauang senla kown. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Nami ni khe dow Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi nasenah kownkow chenchap maten narü kown. Nami khin khe Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi dow huaklu adikma mih iawng ang nachangah kown. Amatni kowi kingküa miuüa dow huaklu adikma mih kowi klüng khe kowh ka arau mih iawng naka ngarau büah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Nami ni khe dow Jerusalem ransu-uüa kowh kawrnga maten kowi ang natüng pe kramra kown. Nami klen kowi kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi paw athuklama ang nachangah kown. Akeng chenchapuüa kowh kawrnga maten paw ang naduta pe mik bowk kown. Tawkchedow Juda maru-uüa kowi dow ang namingkhetah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Nami khi hanow Juda pren kowi kowh akeng mih aluchowuüa maten dow, ‘Jerusalem maru-uüa dow anging kowh kür chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowh Thurai chekhai,’ padow sakdawng kowi natek büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />“Nami ni khe mih Juda maru aluchowuüa kowi dow sawp cheng kowi kowh lün pluplup mih mairing iawng ang nachangah kown, amatni kowi dow chida cheng kowi kowh lün pluplup mih maitawng iawng ang nachangah kown. Amatni dow hawmlawm pra hown lakuai pra riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa maten kowi napiakta kown. Nachenganchepaw Jerusalem maru-uüa dow amatni uowi rah kowi naplan uowi büah iawk kown.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG, akeng marow kowi kowh Judauüa kowi ang narik lawngah kown. Amatni kowi ang narik lawngah kown mih auan dow mang David krungchak hown Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowh kiowrira akeng marow kowi kowh Judauüa lak-e hang pacham hu lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Nami khin khe mih Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi ang nalawngah kown. Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh kür lang khaw mih paw mang David iawng akürma naown kown, now mang David krungchakuüa dow Thurai kramamu iawng amatni pur kowi narik mang kown. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Nami khin khe mih Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi uang sen mih chenchapuüa maten kowi ang napiakta bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawtah mih vüi nanguk nakar büah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Mang David krungchakuüa hown Jerusalem maru-uüa luk kowi sanara hai Thurai chupra saktuak kala mih lümla ang nauang klai pe kown; naiawng rakowi ang prakowi nauang dang büah hanow amatni sawt ang mih rakowi nakar büah kown. Chapa lowkchow mih kowng khe kowh maru kar iawng nakar büah kown; chapa ta kowng khe kowh uowila uiting uangtak mih iawng lainowmma nauowila uiting uangtak büah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />“Nami khin khe dow Jerusalem marow kowi lainowmma maru nanguk nakar kown; Megido nai kowi kowh Hadad Rimawn kua kowi nguk büah kar büah khe kowh iawng nanguk nakar büah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12-14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12-14" />Israel pren kowi kowh krungchakuüa maten alang alangma nakar büah kown. David krungchakuüa, Nathan krungchakuüa, Levi krungchakuüa, Simei krungchakuüa alang alangma nakar büah kown. Akeng mih krungchakuüa maten paw alang alangma nalang kar kown. Masiuüa hown kachakuüa alang alangma nakar büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEC 12:12-14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s">Arup aren dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami ni khe dow mang David krungchak hown Jerusalem marow chakuüa vüi angak hai tasür talawk mih nasaula kownkow krawng dawng hownia tui ang nauang pe lawtah parah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Nami ni khe dow Juda pren kowi kowh arup aren maten kowi ang napiakta bowk kown, now arup aren ming khowm padow amiapaw ka tuak kown nadowi bowt. Amatni pren hownia <char style="w">risi iua</char> hai amatni kowh lümla ngak kowi dow ang nachumta pe bowk kown. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Nami kung kowi paw risi iawng tek lai mih maru che uowi khai tak kowh chalow now aiamat u-pa mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG ming hown en tek dai lai khai. Naiawng rakowi en nakowng kown takla,’ padow natek pe kown. Risi iawng tek lai mih kowi dow aiamat kowh u-pa mih kowng pat aia kowi nasawtah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />“Nami ni khe dow risi iuauüa maten amatni kowh mukmang lawnguan kowi narukrai kown. Amatni dow nakuanla maru kownkow risiuüa iawng dow pawi humma mih tawnguat nakhup büah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Amatni dow, ‘Ang dow risi nadowi. Ang dow üa lup chang mih taih; asowmchow hownia ang dow chang üa lup reng mih chowtaih,’ padow natek büah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Now amia iawng mih chünchü, ‘En downgprang kowi tawng ma lep lawi chow?’ padow lüntaah khai e dow, ‘Ang auiuauüa kim kowi ang cham takhüm khe kowh ang tangen mih ma lep lawi chowbowt,’ padow naklangah kown,” padow CHAKRAMANG tek khai.<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruapur thing mih hai ruapur hawmh pur prakowi nauang own kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Aw saidawng, ang auiua kowi tuah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ang kowh ruapur thing mih kowi tuah diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">nahanow ruapur hawmuüa dow nataset kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ruapur chauüa kowi paw ang naripah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Pren kowi kowh ang maru-uüa kowi nachangah sum bak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">sum bak kowi pre bak mowr dow ang napawta pe asak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">Nachenganchepaw sum bak kowi pabak mih dow nata sing kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Nami abakchow mih kowi dow maih kowi ang napawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">tai kowi achangma thawpah khe kowh iawng ang nachaingah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">amatni kowi dow achangma ang nathawpah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">Chaing kuh khe kowh iawng dow amatni kowi ang chaingah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Amatni lüklau ang mih khin khe ang naklangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘Kowbüah dow ang maru,’ padow ang nakhamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Amatni paw, ‘CHAKRAMANG chowtaih anging kowh Thurai,’ padow natek büah kown,” napa kown.<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s">Palusama kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang chowm mang kown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Sünta, <char style="w">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</char> dow uang ting khowk. Nami ni khe dow Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh dawngthawnguan maten ransu-uüa narupta pe bowk kown, now dawngthawnguan dow amatni pur kowi ransu-uüa nataretah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi nasenah kownkow akeng prenchak maten kowi CHAKRAMANG nakuaah kown. Marow, kim hai üa maten dow ransu-uüa nakhünta pe kown, now masiuüa hawmh maten kowi dow napiak pe siri kown. Marow kowi kowh maru dow dawnglang mowr mih akeng pren kowi nacham uowi nar kown, now dawnglang mowr dow marow kowi nata uowi kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nauang lawt kown, now ransu-uüa kowi alai kowh aia senah iawng akeng prenchakuüa kowi nasenah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Nami ni khe dow Jerusalem satlawt pra kowh kanrawn hungh luk kowi CHAKRAMANG naiowng kown. Nakhowk khe satlawt hownia satkup pra kanrawn hungh dow natalak kown. Nami hungh dow tawngphak pra dawnglang mrawkphak pra dawnglang natasüt kown, now atakra kowi dow lawngrawi aiukma nauang phaw lowk kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Nami khin khe nami hungh takra kowi kowh lawngrawi hown dow enni napowt kown. Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang khe kowh lihowng mang uang khe enni pipu-uüa powt mih iawng dow enni napowt kown. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai mih aia kowh maru chimsaima miuüa maten hown nauang kown.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Nami ni khe dow anowi nauowi kown nadowi; sat hai lama paw nanowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Nami ni dow akeng mih ni iawng nadowi tham. Nami ni dow tawng iawng chow naown kown mih CHAKRAMANG lowkchow taih tuk. Nami ni dow ni paw uowi kown nadowi, uar paw uowi kown nadowi. Tawkchedow iak prakowi nanowi kown.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi Hebrai Baibul kowi chim dowi rakowi tawng chow own mih tukah dowi chekhai.</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Nami khin khe dow Jerusalem hownia masing tui nauang lawt kown; nami tui dow satlawt pra kowh sata kowi dawnglang, satkup pra kowh sata kowi dawnglang nahawr kown. Nami masing tui dow satma khin hai chungrau khin khe khowm padow nahing hawr hüa kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />CHAKRAMANG dow palusama kowi nachowm mang kown. Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lowkchow Thurai padow maru natukah kown, now aia lowkchow mih ming kowi maru nachupiiaah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Geba marow hownia Jerusalem mrawkphak pra kowh Rimawn marow mowr paprenma süng anaima nauang own kown. Nachenganchepaw Jerusalem marow dow alowngma nauowi reng kown. Jerusalem marow dow Benjamin tapplawt hownia anui tapplawt pape mih auown khe kowh tapplawt mowr, Hananel kowi kowh kimkrowng hownia mang kowh grep uih küara mowr nauar kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Jerusalem marow dow tawng nam ni paw piakra piati nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Jerusalem dow thaulangma nauowi bowt kown; nakowi dow maru kawmma nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi kingküa hown sen mih prenchakuüa maten luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla pe makowng hawi kown. Arau uowi dowi matchang amatni buk kowi kowh nga dow nasu kown. Amatni kowh mik dow alak kowi nasu kown, now amatni kowh dai dow nawr lak kowi nasu kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Nami ni khe dow kramra uowima mih takrow takraira nami maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla pe kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni bowkbowk dow lowkkowlowk natakhüm büah kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Juda maru-uüa paw Jerusalem maru-uüa vüi natawi tasen kown. Ariaret kowi kowh prenchakuüa kowh dawngthawnguan, kuh, tai hown dawnguan maten ahuma nakuaah kown.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi Hebrai Baibul kowi chim dowi rakowi tawngbak mih dow Jerusalem kowi natawi senah kown, now tawngbak mih dow Jerusalem vüi natawi tasen kown pahai ruiah khai.</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Akeng prenchak siphaiuüa kowh kawrnga, kawrngaramchük, ut hai akeng mih tawncher luk kowi paw naiawngün makowng hawi dow nauang kla kown.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Nami kung kowi dow Jerusalem kowi uang sen miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta lat miuüa paw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kowi amatni kowh mang iawng dow nauang chup büah kown. Amatni dow Te Pawi nauang sun kownkow ning towng Jerusalem marow kowi nauang kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kownkow palusama maru Jerusalem kowi nauang kown; uang dowi mih chenchapuüa pren kowi dow uang nauang kown nadowi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Aigupta maru-uüa che Jerusalem kowi tawi tarü dowi, CHAKRAMANG kowi che tawi chup dowi hanow amatni pren kowi paw uang nauang kown nadowi. Te Pawi tawi sun kownkow Jerusalem kowi tawi dowi mih prenchakuüa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla pe makowng hawi kown; nami hawi dow Aigupta maru-uüa luk kowi paw nauang kla kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Aigupta hai akeng prenchak maten Te Pawi tawi sun kownkow tawi tarü dowi mih kowi dow nami ripra napeah kown.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Nami khin khe “CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima” padow kawrnga ngawng kowi kowh khawngrawng kowi arui nauowi kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh puh maten dow phuchuara ria kowi kowh achimsaima mih bia iawng achimsaima naown kown. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Jerusalem hai Juda pren kowi kowh puh bia maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachim nasai bowk bowt kown. Now uang phuchua CHAKRAMANG miuüa maten dow naiawngün puh bia hown naeng phuchua müa ngar bowt kown. Nami khin khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kim kowi mia iawng mih paw nachang kun kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>